  note    -

capability xlsx/dimension  the area a sheet's cells hold, from the first row and column used to the last
  heroes  xlsx.dimension_of
  go      File.GetSheetDimension, File.SetSheetDimension
  rust    calamine::Dimensions (start, end, len, contains, clamp_to, compare, new), XlsxCellReader.dimensions
  python  Worksheet.dimensions, Worksheet.calculate_dimension, Worksheet.min_row, max_row, min_column, max_column
